];
// [1] JP 3-09.3, Close Air Support (25 November 2014), by printed page.
// [2] US Naval Academy, Fundamentals of Naval Weapons Systems, ch. 10 and 15, by section.
// [3] Falcon BMS 4.38.1 Training Manual and [4] DCS: A-10C II Flight Manual, sim crossover only.
